  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh Agricultural Research and Technology Support Project (ARTS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The project development objective is to improve agricultural productivity and farm incomes in the country through research into appropriate technology, increased adoption of low risk-high reward technologies in marginalized areas, and fostering farmers&#xE2;&#x20AC;&#x2122; links to markets.
 
  The project will build on the lessons learned and good practices developed in the World Bank financed Bangladesh National Agricultural Technology Project and the Bangladesh Integrated Agricultural Productivity Project.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
